# FFI+II Famicom restoration public release
# Documentation and verified IPS patches are intended here, plus one explicit,
# owner-approved completed-game SRAM artifact already tracked in saves/.
# New private saves, game ROMs, prepatched images, archives and generated assets
# should not be committed. The blanket *.srm ignore rule remains for new saves.
# .gitignore does not exclude the already tracked, approved completion save.

# Complete cartridge/ROM/disk images
*.nes
*.NES
*.unf
*.unif
*.rom
*.ROM
*.bin
*.BIN
*.iso
*.ISO
*.img
*.IMG
*.chd
*.CHD

# Saves and emulator state
*.sav
*.srm
*.state
*.state.*
*.fds
*.dmp
*.dump
*.ram

# Bundles, temporary files, and executable outputs
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.exe
*.dll
*.o
*.obj
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak

# Local data, workspaces, and secrets
/private/
/roms/
/ROMs/
/work/
/workbench/
/scratch/
/build/
/output/
/dist/
/test-roms/
/backups/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Deliberately NOT ignored: *.ips (intended reviewed release files).
# Note: .gitignore does not erase already tracked files.
